    "Scan of the 1948 edition of the Spesutie, Maryland, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1944; aerial photographs from 1981; field checked in 1948; photo revised in 1984; last revised in 1984; printed in 1985.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
